cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the prediction artifacts it contains, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "cpath-triage: diagnostic analysis of verbalized confidence in a medical vision-language model"
abstract: >-
  Evaluation and analysis code, plus the prediction artifacts behind every table
  and figure, for a diagnostic study of verbalized confidence in MedGemma-27b-it
  on colorectal H&E histopathology patches. Covers zero-shot classification,
  temperature scaling and calibration metrics, selective-prediction routing with
  explicit tie handling, a design-effect sensitivity analysis in place of
  clustered intervals, and K=5 prompt-variant consistency routing.
type: software
